00:55:39.970 --> 00:55:55.280
<v Ira Glass>Right, Yeah, this is the main thing I learned watching this, is that Dan and I made our moms take part in a show that was really, really dirty.
<v Ira Glass>没错，是的，我从观看这段视频中学到的主要东西是，丹和我让我们的妈妈参与了一个真的、真的很脏的节目。

